{"id":1660,"skill":"listening","title":"[C3T1] - Application form","type":2,"quizType":3,"durationMin":60,"thumbnail":"c0987675-0f2a-4bad-83a8-47b5a7ee9e47","thumbnailUrl":"/assets/thumbs-listening/1660.jpg","totalSubmitted":490,"voteCount":0,"isPublic":true,"quizCode":"","dateUpdated":"2026-05-06T22:49:49.312239+07:00","tags":[{"id":37,"code":"section_3","title":"Section 3"},{"id":6,"code":"FILL_BLANK","title":"Gap Filling"}],"parts":[{"id":1736,"index":3,"title":"","transcriptHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-600 text-lg font-bold\">Application form</h3>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Hello. Jonathan Briggs, isn't it?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> Yes, that's right.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Do come in and sit down.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> Thanks.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Right. Well, Jonathan, as we explained in your letter, in this part of the interview we like to talk through your application form... your experience to date, etc... and then in the second part you go for a group interview.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> Group interview... Yes, I understand...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> So... your first degree was in Economics?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> {[Yes, but I also did Politics as a major strand.][1]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> And you graduated in 1989. And I see you have been doing some teaching...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> {[Yes. I worked as a volunteer teacher in West Africa.][2]}{[ I was there for almost three years in total from 1990 to... umm... 1992.][3]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> How interesting. What organization was that with?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> {[It's not one of the major ones. It's called Teach South.][5]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Oh, right. Yes, I have heard of it. It operates in several African countries, doesn't it? {[And what kind of school was it?][6]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> {[A rural co-operative.][6]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Oh, a rural co-operative, how interesting... and what did you teach?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> {[A variety of things in different years... ummm... I did... with Forms 1 to 3 mainly Geography][7]}{[ and some English with Form 5. ][8]}Then in my final year I took on some Agricultural Science with the top year . .. that's Form 6.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Right. Quite a variety then...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> I also ran the school farm.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> How interesting...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> ...And how did you find the whole experience?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> {[I'll be honest with you. At the end of the first year I really wanted to leave and come home.][9]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Why was that?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> {[Well... I was very homesick at first and missed my family...][9]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Umm... I can quite understand that.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> ...and I also found it frustrating to have so few teaching resources, but I did decide to stay and in the end I extended my tour to a third year.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Right. Things must have looked up then?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> Yes. We set up a very successful project breeding cattle to sell locally.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Really?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> And then after a lot of hard work we finally got funds for new farm buildings.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> And you wanted to see things through?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> Uh-huh.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> {[And is that why you want to train to teach Geography?][10]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>JB:</strong> Yes. I've had a couple of jobs since then but I now realize I like teaching best. {[And I chose Geography because... because it is my favorite subject... ][10]}{[and also because I think it has so many useful applications.][11]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>TUTOR:</strong> Well... you certainly have had some interesting work experience. I'll ask you now to go on to the next stage of...</p>","transcriptSegments":[{"paragraph":0,"sentences":[{"id":555912,"text":"Application form","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":1,"sentences":[{"id":555916,"text":"TUTOR:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":2,"sentences":[{"id":555919,"text":"Hello.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":555922,"text":"Jonathan Briggs, isn’t it?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":3,"sentences":[{"id":555928,"text":"JB:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":4,"sentences":[{"id":555931,"text":"Yes, that’s right.","from":null,"to":null,"spea